    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SAP312 · Chapter 2 · Session 2</span>\n<h2>Session 2 — Unit 1: Introduction to ERP and SAP S4HANA</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14200 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SAP312 · Chương 2 · Buổi 2</span>\n<h2>Buổi 2 — Unit 1: Introduction to ERP and SAP S4HANA</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14200 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">6</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">6</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Unit 1: Introduction to ERP and SAP S4HANA<br>Lecture<br>Introduction to ERP</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 1, Concepts in Enterprise Resource Planning, Ellen F. Monk and Bret J. Wagner Cengage Learning, 2012, 4th, ISBN: 9781111820398</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>-Read slides before the course</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction (6 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by content (deck title ↔ session topic). File: FSoft-EBS_ERP_SAP-Introduction.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction (6 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo nội dung (tên deck ↔ chủ đề buổi). Tệp: FSoft-EBS_ERP_SAP-Introduction.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAP312/flm1/d02/001.webp\" alt=\"SAP312 · FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 1: 1\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 1/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>1<br>ERP and SAP Introduction<br>Feb 2023</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAP312/flm1/d02/002.webp\" alt=\"SAP312 · FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 2: WHAT IS ERP? HOW IT LOOK LIKE IN REAL LIFE?\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 2/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>WHAT IS ERP? HOW IT LOOK LIKE IN REAL LIFE?<br>2<br>ONLINE<br>ONLINE<br>B2B<br>Manufacturing Company<br>Distributor /<br>Trading Company<br>Sales Team<br>Customer<br>E-Commerce<br>Consumer<br>Sales Team<br>Shipping<br>Pick at store<br>Shipping<br>ERP Services<br>DMS Services<br>Retailer, e-Commerce, POS &amp; Loyalty Services<br>Integration and Data Analytic Services</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAP312/flm1/d02/003.webp\" alt=\"SAP312 · FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 3: ERP History Together with SAP\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 3/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>ERP History Together with SAP<br>3<br>2010s<br>Cloud-Based<br>First time, Gartner used term ‘ERP’<br>1972<br>SAP was founded in Germany (MM, FI)<br>1982<br>Mainframe infrastructure<br>1992<br>Fully integration ERP<br>2015 S4 Hana<br>In-memory and Cloud Computing</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAP312/flm1/d02/004.webp\" alt=\"SAP312 · FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 4: SAP MODULES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 4/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>SAP MODULES<br>4</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAP312/flm1/d02/005.webp\" alt=\"SAP312 · FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 5: 5\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 5/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>5<br>Q&amp;A<br>Q&amp;A</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAP312/flm1/d02/006.webp\" alt=\"SAP312 · FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 6: 6\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">FSoft-EBS ERP SAP-Introduction · slide 6/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>6<br>THANK YOU</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
